*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif

# Workspace Assets & Media (Exclude all workspace media/assets while keeping folder structure)
assets/incoming/**
!assets/incoming/**/.gitkeep
assets/cache/**
!assets/cache/**/.gitkeep
assets/processing/**
!assets/processing/**/.gitkeep
assets/ready/**
!assets/ready/**/.gitkeep

# Explicit Test Fixtures Exceptions (Required by AI & Speech verification)
